  _name: A Rather Sticky Problem
  _description: Kill 12 green slimes
  _storyDescription: Green slime is spreading around the paths and sticking to boots, carts, and one very unlucky goat. Clear it out.
  _activeQuestDialogue: 'Green slime is still spreading along the paths. Please clear it before it reaches the carts and the goat pens.'
  _turnInDialogue: 'The green slime is gone from the paths and carts. Even the goat is grateful. Thank you for cleaning up the mess.'
  _completedQuestDialogueLines:
  - 'The paths are clear, and the goat has stopped sticking to everything. Thank you.'
  - 'No more green slime on the carts. The traders will be glad to hear it.'
  - 'You cleaned up that sticky mess before it spread further. I owe you a clean pair of boots.'
